Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.54,0:00:05.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Chancellor, if you could switch jobs, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:10.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,with Jensen for even a day, what would you do first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.87,0:00:12.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:14.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Change jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:15.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Would you like to go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.79,0:00:19.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,No. Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:21.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...I'll give you my answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'd better put on my leather jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.64,0:00:29.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would take a plane to Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:32.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to meet the German Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.70,0:00:36.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I would tell him I was ready to invest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:40.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, that's exactly what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.06,0:00:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think you could arrange a meeting, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.16,0:00:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nobody...nobody invested more in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:46.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.04,0:00:48.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are truly very grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:52.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you for doing this, it's a great signal for our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:53.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.11,0:00:54.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.15,0:00:55.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:01:00.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,The history of Nvidia and the history of Germany played a very big role.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.95,0:01:06.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, in 2000, Nvidia was a consumer-focused technology company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:09.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,We only created products for PC gaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:18.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it was a company in Germany, Elsa, whose partnership led us to workstations, which in turn led us to all the car companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.12,0:01:26.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today we collaborate with automakers: from style, design, engineering, modeling, production, and even the cars themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.51,0:01:32.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was in 2005 that Audi brought us into the automotive industry, right into the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:35.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it was 2023.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:37.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was it 2023?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:38.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,2020?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:44.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, in 2020, Ola and I entered into a partnership to create autonomous vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:48.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, Germany and Nvidia have been very close for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Jensen, I think I already heard that you wouldn't want to change jobs, so I won't even ask what you would do as Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:02:04.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll leave you to yourself for now, and I suspect you're already seeing things that we may not even imagine yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.50,0:02:08.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, take us to the engineering office or the factory of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.49,0:02:09.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:11.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,What will it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:14.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.71,0:02:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,In fact, every company in the future will have two factories.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.44,0:02:23.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,A factory that is real and a factory that is digital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.41,0:02:28.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the digital factory will be so real that it can be considered real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.91,0:02:38.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you create a digital twin of your company, your car company, that digital twin could be very real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.14,0:02:48.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, in the future, I believe that most people here in Germany will mostly work in a digital twin of their company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,They will build digital cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.55,0:02:54.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,These cars will have digital brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Production, factories will have digital, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.85,0:03:04.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,robots with artificial intelligence that will work in robotic enterprises and build cars that will also be robotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:07.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,And everything will be completely controlled by software.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:10.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything will be completely controlled by artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:12.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, each company will create two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:18.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,They will create " brains" —intelligent systems that will be integrated into the products they supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.26,0:03:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And therefore, Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, that would be cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:29.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chancellor, of course, your vision is to introduce artificial intelligence into everyday use throughout German industry:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:32.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,from large manufacturers, the " Mittelstand," to smaller firms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.33,0:03:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could you share some concrete examples of how you and the German government are ensuring that this broad implementation actually happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:43.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:53.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,First of all, I would like to say that I am very impressed with what Nvidia and German companies are already doing in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ola Kallenius just handed me a model of the new Mercedes S-Class,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.76,0:04:06.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,promising that the car will have autonomous driving functionality in Germany by the end of this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.36,0:04:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The safest and most autonomous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.25,0:04:12.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is happening in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:21.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,We in the government are fully committed to becoming one of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.56,0:04:25.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,the most advanced places in the world—not just in the European Union,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.46,0:04:32.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,but globally—for working with artificial intelligence and integrating AI into our industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:40.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,And one of the biggest, if not the biggest, advantage that we have in Germany is our so-called " Mittelstand."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm very happy to see that many small and medium-sized companies from Germany are here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:56.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please open your doors for artificial intelligence to use your data.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:05:01.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is extremely important for the future of Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.44,0:05:12.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the real secret and a real advantage for Germany— to use all the data that is already available in our companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:17.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if we could combine this artificial intelligence with companies
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.93,0:05:24.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,like yours and our companies in Germany—both large and Mittelstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:29.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am very optimistic that we will be one of the leading,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:35.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,if not the leading country in the world in terms of the pace of deployment of artificial intelligence for all our companies:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,manufacturers, the engineering and automotive industries, as well as their suppliers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:46.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think this is a great opportunity, and I am enthusiastic about its implementation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.61,0:05:49.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:54.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.10,0:06:04.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Germany's data is part of your natural resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:08.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,They belong to the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:15.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Data, your digital experience or what is otherwise called “ data”—your country’s data—is your culture,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:21.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,your values, your knowledge, your experience; it is your natural resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.60,0:06:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,He belongs to the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:36.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you are absolutely right that you should import the technology to collect this data and turn it into your national intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.38,0:06:44.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you should not export your culture, your values, your knowledge, your history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:49.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then importing German intelligence back—that makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, that's the first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:59.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so you should, you have every right, of course, to use the best AI technologies and services available in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.00,0:07:02.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you have every opportunity to create your own AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, that's the first thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second is the next wave of AI—it's physical AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.49,0:07:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the area where AI interacts with the physical world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Robotics, manufacturing, automobiles, heavy industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,This will never be replaced by digital technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:34.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,The work you know belongs to you, that knowledge belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.34,0:07:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Expertise in your field belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.69,0:07:44.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,General artificial intelligence will never replace industry expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:50.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can be as intelligent a general intelligence as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:59.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will never be as smart as someone who is very, very specialized in a specific area of electromechanical technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This cannot be replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:04.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, AI can only expand your capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will not replace your potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:09.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,So take advantage of this technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.58,0:08:16.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a new tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.87,0:08:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,On some of these advantages, Jensen, we have, on the one hand, decades of industrial data.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.55,0:08:27.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a very, let's say, qualified workforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.82,0:08:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have engineering experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:36.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this certainly, as you seem to have noted, shows great benefits for Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have a global perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:43.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, there are other countries that also have strengths and would also like to take advantage of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You communicate with many governments around the world, with many companies around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.33,0:08:52.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taking this global perspective,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.92,0:09:00.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,how ready is Germany for this next race in AI?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:12.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,As you know, the last great industrial revolution was electrification before the one I will describe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.59,0:09:17.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electrification has led to the emergence of three true geographical leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:24.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Germany, the United States, Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.62,0:09:35.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over the past 50 years, due to the current industrial revolution, which is computing and digital technology,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.33,0:09:44.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the US has largely exported its heavy manufacturing, construction, craftsmanship, essentially to China.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.52,0:09:47.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, now there are three leaders in the world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.69,0:09:55.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this is Germany, Japan and China.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:59.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,China's advantage is that their industrial revolution, if you will,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.57,0:10:05.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,their economic transformation, happened precisely in the era of the computer industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.94,0:10:10.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are quite computerized.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.93,0:10:17.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,China today is perhaps the only country that is deeply integrated into both manufacturing and computer science.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:20.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,And he feels very confident in both areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.91,0:10:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, the good news is that a complete reboot is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:30.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last 50 years have been dedicated to software programming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:34.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The United States is obviously the world leader in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,But now a new era has dawned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.48,0:10:40.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,The computer programs itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just need to show the computer what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:54.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Computer programming, all the advantages of the previous generation are now accumulated in artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:59.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is a complete reboot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:06.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the digital technology in the world will not replace electromechanical physical technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Electrons will never replace atoms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.45,0:11:13.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's the advantage you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.23,0:11:21.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,The work you know, the industry expertise you have, the skills that are here, they are here to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you have to take advantage of this new technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:32.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This industrial revolution is so grand and powerful that you won't get another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because you always...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:34.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether we have another chance or not, we must always assume that we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:44.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This transition is extremely important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You should combine your deep skills, your deep experience in physical products, in electromechanical products.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:11:59.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.10,0:12:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And combine it with artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:11.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if most Mittelstand companies are now facing the problem of workforce reductions as people age.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.82,0:12:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:24.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mastery that is recorded in the knowledge and skills of people becomes older with each generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:26.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Use artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:28.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let them codify.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let them program.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.93,0:12:34.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let them train this artificial intelligence and keep it here in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.14,0:12:34.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:37.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And let him rethink the Chancellor's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:38.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:39.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Chancellor's words.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:41.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rethinking Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:42.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.19,0:12:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is your chance to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I think it's become clear that the prerequisites for scaling industrial AI in Germany are...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:13:02.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, and they are very promising, and the opportunities associated with them are impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.15,0:13:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course, Chancellor, bridging the gap between innovation and implementation in factories and value chains will be key.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.65,0:13:18.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is collaborating with Nvidia part of the plan for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:19.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:21.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is already happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:26.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to say that I am extremely grateful for
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.61,0:13:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,what we just heard from this global business leader in AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:42.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you give me and, I hope, us great optimism about our business model in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.77,0:13:51.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you may know that I always insist that we must remain a manufacturing country.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:54.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we should never give up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:14:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now we see a great opportunity in combining our expertise in manufacturing and AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.73,0:14:10.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, if we can bring these two aspects and business directions of the future together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.62,0:14:17.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm very optimistic that Germany can become one of the most successful economies in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.09,0:14:23.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,because we already are, we're still the third largest economy in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,So thank you for telling us what the opportunity is and comparing us to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.45,0:14:39.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I believe, and I share your opinion that Americans made a big mistake by exporting their production.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.34,0:14:45.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And now they are faced with a very small, successful, but very limited industrial base.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:53.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is our advantage— to have broader access and a broader approach to the future of our industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:15:01.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And look, I represent a large American company, and we have incredible partnerships here in Germany, and there are good reasons for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.81,0:15:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:05.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is good for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.22,0:15:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partnership with Audi led to our partnership with Mercedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.13,0:15:16.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Our partnership with Mercedes led to our investment in robotics, which in turn led to a partnership with Agile Robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,We just made an investment in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:21.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,We invested in Avelios.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:24.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I made an investment in Muralla.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:29.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,We made an investment in Reflex Aerospace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Last year we invested in Black Forest Labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:39.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here in Germany, you have deep scientific and technological knowledge, deep science and mathematics,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:45.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,which are the basis for manufacturing, deep sciences and artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.83,0:15:52.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,So there's so much technical expertise here, so much deep science and deep mathematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:16:00.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another thing you mentioned is that you believe in policies to promote and support AI startups or startups in general.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.10,0:16:01.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think it's fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the things I really love about the United States, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:09.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is that we are constantly renewing ourselves, we are constantly reinventing ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.33,0:16:11.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we do this thanks to all entrepreneurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:17.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, one of the things I'm really happy to see is that we've invested a lot in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:21.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have invested almost a billion dollars over the past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:24.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This week we are investing in four new companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:27.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,So in many ways we are one of the
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:36.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,largest venture capitalists in Germany because I believe in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.04,0:16:45.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so all the other venture capitalists better hurry up, or I'll take all the good deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:49.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I will get rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:57.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, the most important thing I want to emphasize is that Germany's scientific and technological potential is simply unparalleled.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.36,0:16:59.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a thousand employees here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.23,0:17:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have a great office here in Berlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.93,0:17:07.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some of our company's fundamental inventions originated in our Berlin office in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, it is worth investing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:11.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Incredible people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:14.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:17.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Can you give us some advice on regulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.63,0:17:23.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,In Brussels, at the European level, we are having a very heated discussion, compared to the US.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.51,0:17:28.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is the best way to regulate this industry or this new technology?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.51,0:17:35.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think we agree that no regulation is not the right answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Too strict regulation is also not the right answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.96,0:17:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,But what do you think is the right answer, given the potential harm that could and has happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.60,0:17:54.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,So what is your advice on regulation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:57.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What can we do better than others?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:58.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Safety is above all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.77,0:17:59.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This industry has no future without safe products.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just as there is no future in autonomous vehicles if they are not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:10.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,So it's not a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.75,0:18:14.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't choose between security and functionality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,They are the only ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,They should go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:19.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, three pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.79,0:18:25.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first is that you can't regulate something that does n't yet exist technologically.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.74,0:18:30.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the technology industry must Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.04,0:18:36.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,The technology industry must invent technologies for security.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like Ola and I had to invent the technology, and now we have the safest autonomous vehicle in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,We had to invent a technology that would achieve the desired functionality,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:55.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,as well as guarantee the functional and active safety that we were aiming to provide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.10,0:18:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this requires the invention of technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:18:59.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the first pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,But this is something that Germany is incredibly strong at.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.49,0:19:06.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your science, your mathematics, your technology are of incredible quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:09.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have to invent security technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:11.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Security is not dreams and hopes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.70,0:19:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Security is technology and engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.64,0:19:19.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Second, companies must follow best practices.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:27.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sometimes young companies are still trying to grow up and may make more mistakes than they should.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:32.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,We need to make sure that companies are following best practices and methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:39.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,even in the area of ​​safety, as many in the audience probably work in the automotive industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know that security is a deep methodology, deep best practices, and deep engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.64,0:19:49.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this methodology must be followed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.36,0:19:54.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally, there are industry and government regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.82,0:19:59.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it turns out that, and remember, AI is two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like the Internet: regulating the Internet is difficult, but regulating Internet applications is not so difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should regulate these apps now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.21,0:20:19.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,So if there are AI technologies that are being applied to a new type of product that is not covered by current regulators,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:25.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,they should assess this as soon as possible and make sure their regulation includes AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.93,0:20:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I also heard you say that you want to find a balance between innovation and regulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:41.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,There is nothing to regulate if the industry is not developing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:47.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,You want the German AI industry to thrive and also operate safely and responsibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.51,0:20:50.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I think this balance is extremely important.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.75,0:20:57.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,I think the answer is that we know: there are technologies that we can develop and implement to ensure the safety of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.95,0:21:03.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,We know that there are best practices that we can follow as a company and an industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.25,0:21:07.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,And in addition to this, if necessary, we will provide regulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.42,0:21:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:11.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Briefly, Chancellor, what would be your answer to this very question?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:12.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe very briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:13.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.01,0:21:19.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,This was extremely useful as we are discussing this at the European level.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.07,0:21:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are talking about this at a national level, and my approach is that we need at least a European level,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:32.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,and better yet, a global level of regulation and security for this fantastic new technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.16,0:21:43.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is my personal opinion, but we are still far from it, as we have different approaches from Americans and Europeans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.16,0:21:46.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we are working on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:50.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,and most in this room know that I managed to get the AI ​​regulation for
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,the mechanical engineering industry in Germany out of the general AI regulation in the European Union,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.08,0:22:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,so that it is not part of the general AI restrictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:06.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, this was a great achievement that we achieved in Europe. chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:06.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.95,0:22:07.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.35,0:22:09.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give this industry a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.45,0:22:11.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.05,0:22:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,And finally, very briefly, Chancellor: if Jensen were to return in a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.53,0:22:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,which we very much hope he will, what would you like him to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.85,0:22:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I would like to see him regularly, say at least once a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.77,0:22:39.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,discuss our progress and see him sitting in my office, very pleased with the investment climate in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.70,0:22:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nothing would bring me greater joy than to see all my investments in Germany turn into gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:23:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, I have full, I have full confidence, and I'm very, very happy to hear your personal support for the startup ecosystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.37,0:23:10.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am very happy to hear that there are regulations that allow pension funds and venture capital to come to Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.25,0:23:20.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I'm also, I'm also really excited to hear about all the AI ​​startups and startups that have come out in the last couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.18,0:23:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Half of the startups in Germany founded in the last two years are artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.37,0:23:26.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.55,0:23:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is oriented.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.96,0:23:28.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.29,0:23:32.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe next year you'll be asking them for autographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.48,0:23:35.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can take the pen when you arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.26,0:23:44.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,When they achieve breakthroughs, some of them, I understand, used to be your interns, and now they run their own companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.24,0:23:46.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was nice to see you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.20,0:23:47.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:49.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, please, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.74,0:23:54.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,give Chancellor Mertz and Jensen Huang a round of applause.
